    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Quillsen are delighted to present 10 Beechlawn Grove to the market; a well-maintained semi-detached family home. No. 10 is centrally located in this mature and popular residential neighbourhood, with generous accommodation extending to a spacious 117sqm and private gardens to the front and rear. \nBeechlawn Grove is conveniently situated with access points off Kilmore Road and Oscar Traynor Road and is positioned adjacent to amenities within Coolock Village. A host of amenities within Coolock, Artane and Beaumont are within close proximity alongside Northside Shopping Centre, Artane Castle Shopping Centre and Beaumont Hospital. The M50 / M1 road network is within easy reach and numerous bus routes along the Malahide Road, Kilmore Road & Oscar Traynor Road provide excellent connectivity to Dublin City Centre and further afield. Dublin Airport, Eastpoint Business Park and the IFSC are also within easy commute. \nThe property is well maintained throughout and offers its new owners a wonderful opportunity to create a forever home whilst further potential to extend the property to the side / rear if required.\nAccommodation is bright and spacious throughout, offering a practical and flexible layout and briefly comprises; entrance hall, lounge - living room, kitchen diner, tv room / office, three bedrooms and bathroom. \nThe property is not overlooked to the front or rear and is positioned close to a neighbourhood green used by local residents for a host of recreational activities.\nTo the rear the private garden is approx. 11.5 metres in length, is mainly in lawn with a patio area and offers scope to extend the property further if required (subject to any necessary planning permissions required). Bordered by mature shrubbery, the rear garden captures east and southerly light throughout the day and provides a private and tranquil outdoor space. \nTo the front the garden provides off street parking and offers scope to enlarge the driveway to provide parking for two-three vehicles. \n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall\nTimber flooring and carpeted stairs.\n\nLivingroom - 4.18m (13'9\") x 4.16m (13'8\")\nAcccessed of the hallway and with interconnecting doors to the lounge this spacious room overlooks the private rear garden, timber flooring, decorative coving and feature fireplace with gas insert.\n\nKitchen/Diner - 5.59m (18'4\") x 2.98m (9'9\")\nSpacious kitchen dining space with double doors leading to the rear garden. Fitted kitchen, tiled floor and double doors leading to the tv room / home office.\n\nTV room/office - 4.71m (15'5\") x 2.73m (8'11\")\nFlexible living space suitable as a tv room, home office, children`s playroom.\n\nFront Bedroom 1 - 4.24m (13'11\") x 4.11m (13'6\")\nSpacious double bedroom with fitted wardrobes and timber flooring.\n\nRear Bedroom - 4.11m (13'6\") x 2.88m (9'5\")\nSspacious double bedroom with timber flooring.\n\nSingle Bedroom - 2.92m (9'7\") x 2.27m (7'5\")\nSsingle bedroom with fitted wardrobes.\n\nBathroom\nRecently upgraded, fully tiled wet room, electric shower, w.c and whb with vanity unit.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Semi - property with excellent potential to extend (subject to any necessary planning). </li><li> Private rear garden approx. 11.5 metres in length - Not Overlooked. </li><li> Alarm, Gas Fired Central Heating, Double Glazed Windows. </li><li> Attic space suitable for conversion. </li><li> Off- street parking. </li><li> Proximity to amenities in Coolock Village, Artane & Beaumont. </li><li> Mature and sought after central location. </li><li> Excellent local primary and secondary schools. </li><li> Excellent transport links.</li></ul>"
      },
